.env.local
node_modules
dist
src/convex/_generated

# Platform build snapshot (a full copy of a build: index.html + assets/).
# It must be ignored, and not only because it is a build artefact — Tailwind
# auto-detects source files by walking the project, and this directory was not
# excluded. It therefore kept *resurrecting* class names from old builds into
# the stylesheet: a `max-h-[45dvh]` that had been removed from the source was
# still being emitted weeks later purely because a stale bundle still contained
# the literal string. Ignoring it keeps the CSS honest about what is used.
isolate